 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "It is hard for a rich man to enter",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 1.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "The kingdom of heaven is far from him",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A camel through the eye of a needle",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.99,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Is easier than his path to God",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The disciples asked who can be saved",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.15,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "When such a heavy burden is laid",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.83,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "With people this is impossible",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 1.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But with God all things are possible",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.42,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "With people this is impossible",
